## Load the GoogLeNet Model

```elixir
alias Evision, as: Cv

model = Cv.DNN.readNet("googlenet-8.onnx")
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
%Evision.DNN.Net{ref: #Reference<0.4003430890.1440088085.55917>}
```

### Set Backend and Target

```elixir
model =
  model
  |> Cv.DNN.Net.setPreferableBackend(Cv.Constant.cv_DNN_BACKEND_DEFAULT())
  |> Cv.DNN.Net.setPreferableTarget(Cv.Constant.cv_DNN_TARGET_CPU())
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
%Evision.DNN.Net{ref: #Reference<0.4003430890.1440088085.55917>}
```

## Read the Test Image and Set It as the Input

```elixir
mat = Cv.imread("space_shuttle.jpg")

# GoogLeNet was trained in Caffe on BGR images with the per-channel mean subtracted
blob = Cv.DNN.blobFromImage(mat, mean: {104, 117, 123}, size: {224, 224})

model = Cv.DNN.Net.setInput(model, blob)
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
%Evision.DNN.Net{ref: #Reference<0.4003430890.1440088085.55917>}
```

### Run the Forward Function

```elixir
start_time = :os.system_time(:millisecond)
[pred] = Cv.DNN.Net.forward(model)
end_time = :os.system_time(:millisecond)
"Inference time=>#{end_time - start_time} ms"
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
"Inference time=>49 ms"
```

## Get the Classification Result
```elixir
pred = Cv.Mat.to_nx(pred, Nx.BinaryBackend)
pred_class_id = pred |> Nx.argmax() |> Nx.to_number()
confidence = Nx.to_number(pred[[0, pred_class_id]])
class_label = Enum.at(classes, pred_class_id)

"Predict result: #{class_label}=>#{Float.round(confidence * 100, 2)}"
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
"Predict result: space shuttle=>99.99"
```
